XddYfYo3dpexESScc7nwQnEb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Made of high-strength aluminum alloy, lightweight and durable</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UZOSdVqZKoSdzax3fXAcsmaOnDf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Surface treated with precision anodizing to resist corrosion</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AEz9dVudSolh95xXt8ScuFkQnTd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>1/4-20 UNC thread, compatible with most photographic and mounting equipment</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZdScdW8XloIM5qxHeUmc1tKcnbf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Easy to tighten and loosen by hand without tools</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OPbAdscFLoskSMxPVoxcIRC9nub\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Recessed hollow head with 6-hole design for enhanced grip and reduced weight</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OPbAdscFLoskSMxPVoxcIRC9nub\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ideal for camera tripods, quick release plates, rigs, and other accessories</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 标题加文案结束 --></div>\n</div>",
